<title>USA: Chrysalis Intl Q4 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Chrysalis Intl Q4 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>RARITAN, N.J. 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the three months  For the year</p>
<p>			     ended December 31,  ended December 31,</p>
